WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.540
Part seven: SignUp.com games. See who's working each game, or every game on one day at once.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.889
SignUp.com games are listed from two days ago on.

00:00:12.089 --> 00:00:14.351
Roster shows who's working each stand.

00:00:14.551 --> 00:00:21.520
When there's more than one game on a day, like high school and junior high football, Whole day shows them together.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:30.605
SignUp.com rosters are read only. Change people on SignUp.com, or with Add a worker by hand in the Hub sheet.

00:00:30.805 --> 00:00:35.435
Each stand lists its positions and people, with phone, credit, and program.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:39.420
Open takes you to that volunteer's admin page.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:43.129
The whole day view lists every game on that day.

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:48.557
Each stand shows its lead, or None signed up in red, with a button to text that stand.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:51.467
Full roster opens that game's roster.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:56.220
And Reach out here texts everyone at all of that day's games at once.
